{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2019-10-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'NVIDIA CORPORATION UNVEILS THE GEFORCE GTX 1660 SUPER -- THE SUCCESSOR TO ITS MOST SUCCESSFUL GPU EVER AS WELL AS THE GEFORCE 1650 SUPER', 'text': 'NVIDIA CORPORATION UNVEILED THE GEFORCE GTX 1660 SUPER -- THE SUCCESSOR TO ITS MOST SUCCESSFUL GPU EVER AS WELL AS THE GEFORCE 1650 SUPER. THE NEW GEFORCE GTX 16 SUPER SERIES PACKS A POWERFUL PUNCH FOR MOST POPULAR GAMES, INCLUDING FORTNITE, PUBG AND APEX LEGENDS. THEY ARE POWERED BY THE TURING ARCHITECTURE AND SUPERFAST GDDR6 MEMORY, AND DELIVER UP TO TWICE THE PERFORMANCE OF THE PREVIOUS GENERATION. DESIGNED TO DELIVER EVEN MORE HORSEPOWER FOR TODAY’S MOST POPULAR GAMES, INCLUDING FORTNITE, PUBG AND APEX LEGENDS, THE PAIR DELIVER UP TO 2X THE PERFORMANCE OF THE PRIOR GENERATION GTX 10-SERIES GPUS AND UP TO 50% MORE PERFORMANCE OVER THE ORIGINAL GTX 16-SERIES. THE NEW GPUS ARE POWERED BY THE TURING ARCHITECTURE AND SHIP WITH SUPERFAST GDDR6 MEMORY.'}{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2019-10-28 14:30:00', 'title': 'CARE.AI COLLABORATES WITH NVIDIA', 'text': "CARE.AI COLLABORATES WITH NVIDIA TO PIONEER ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE-ENABLED AUTONOMOUS PATIENT MONITORING IN HEALTHCARE.NVIDIA'S JETSON PLATFORM WILL SERVE AS CORE COMPUTE ENGINE FOR CARE.AI'S AUTONOMOUS MONITORING EDGE SOLUTIONS."}{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2019-10-28 11:30:00', 'title': 'NVIDIA SAYS INTRODUCES NEXT GENERATION OF SHIELD TV STREAMING MEDIA PLAYERS, STARTING AT $149', 'text': 'NVIDIA SAYS INTRODUCES NEXT GENERATION OF SHIELD TV STREAMING MEDIA PLAYERS, STARTING AT $149.NVIDIA SAYS SHIELD TV & SHIELD TV PRO AVAILABLE NOW AND SHIP IN U.S., CANADA AND SOME EUROPEAN COUNTRIES.NVIDIA SAYS SHIELD TV PRO WITH REMOTE, 3GB OF MEMORY AND 16GB OF STORAGE IS AVAILABLE FOR $199.NVIDIA SAYS NEW SHIELD TVS WILL BE AVAILABLE IN AUSTRALIA & NEW ZEALAND IN COMING MONTHS.'}{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2019-10-27 22:30:00', 'title': 'NVIDIA ANNOUNCES LAUNCH OF NVIDIA SHIELD TV', 'text': 'NVIDIA RAISED THE BAR HIGHER S