ER COLORS NEVER SEEN BEFORE ON A SCREEN, WITH DRAMATIC CONTRAST, HIGHLIGHTS THAT ARE UP TO 40X BRIGHTER, AND BLACKS THAT ARE 10X DARKER. DOLBY ATMOS REPRESENTS A LEAP FORWARD FROM SURROUND SOUND, TRANSPORTING LISTENERS INTO AN EXTRAORDINARY EXPERIENCE WITH MOVING AUDIO THAT FLOWS AROUND THEM. LISTENERS WILL FEEL LIKE THEY ARE INSIDE THE ACTION AS THE SOUNDS OF PEOPLE, PLACES, THINGS AND MUSIC COME ALIVE WITH BREATHTAKING REALISM. SHIELD BENEFITS FROM NVIDIA’S AI LEADERSHIP TO OFFER FEATURES LACKING IN COMPETING DEVICES. IN ADDITION TO BUILT-IN GOOGLE ASSISTANT AND AMAZON ECHO CONNECTIVITY, THE NEW STREAMERS USE AN AI UPSCALER TO BRING HD CONTENT TO LIFE. TRAINED ON A DEEP NEURAL NETWORK, THE UPSCALER LETS SHIELD OWNERS WATCH 720P AND 1080P CONTENT IN BEAUTIFUL 4K. SHIELD BOASTS THE WIDEST RANGE OF GAMING CONTENT ON A STREAMING MEDIA DEVICE WITH SUPPORT FOR CLOUD GAMING, LOCAL STREAMING AND ADVANCED NATIVE GAMES. GAMERS CAN ENJOY HUNDREDS OF SUPPORTED GAMES IN THE GEFORCE NOW™ BETA, INCLUDING MANY RECENT RELEASES AND TOP FREE-TO-PLAY GAMES LIKE FORTNITE. SHIELD TV AND SHIELD TV PRO ARE AVAILABLE NOW AND SHIP IN THE U.S., CANADA AND SELECT EUROPEAN COUNTRIES. SHIELD TV STARTS AT $149 WITH REMOTE. SHIELD TV PRO WITH REMOTE, 3GB OF MEMORY AND 16GB OF STORAGE IS AVAILABLE FOR $199.'}{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2019-10-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'NVIDIA CORPORATION UNVEILS THE GEFORCE GTX 1660 SUPER -- THE SUCCESSOR TO ITS MOST SUCCESSFUL GPU EVER AS WELL AS THE GEFORCE 1650 SUPER', 'text': 'NVIDIA CORPORATION UNVEILED THE GEFORCE GTX 1660 SUPER -- THE SUCCESSOR TO ITS MOST SUCCESSFUL GPU EVER AS WELL AS THE GEFORCE 1650 SUPER. THE NEW GEFORCE GTX 16 SUPER SERIES PACKS A POWERFUL PUNCH FOR MOST POPULAR GAMES, INCLUDING FORTNITE, PUBG AND APEX LEGENDS. THEY ARE POWERED BY THE TURING ARCHITECTURE AND SUPERFAST GDDR6 MEMORY, AND DELIVER UP TO TWICE THE PERFORMANCE OF THE PREVIOUS GENERATION. DESIGNED TO DELIVER EVEN MORE HORSEPOWER FOR TODAY’S MOST POPULAR GAMES, INCLUDING FORTN